the scoremap of 13 is 87.

the scoremap of 14 is 100.

the move move with a board, a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is legal at a time if
    the board cell the thing with the second thing with knight at the time
    and the thing knightmove the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing
    and it is not the case that the board is the step of 16 at the time.

the goal of robot is a number at a time if
    a count captures at the time
    and the scoremap of the count is the number.

the game is terminal at a time if
    b is the step of 16 at the time.

when the move move with a board, a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is made
then the board cell the third thing with the fourth thing with knight
    and the board cell the thing with the second thing with blank
    and it is not the case that the board cell the third thing with the fourth thing with blank
    and it is not the case that the board cell the third thing with the fourth thing with pawn
    and it is not the case that the board cell the thing with the second thing with knight.

when the move move with b, a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is made
    and b cell the third thing with the fourth thing with pawn
    and a count captures
    and the succ of the count is a fifth thing
then the fifth thing captures
    and it is not the case that the count captures.

when the move move with a board, a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is made
    and the board is the step of an old
    and the succ of the old is a fifth thing
then the board is the step of the fifth thing
    and it is not the case that the board is the step of the old.

it must not be true that
    the move move with a board, a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is made
    and it is not the case that the move move with the board, the thing, the second thing, the third thing and the fourth thing is legal.

